{"path":"fees.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Investment — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Clear, clinician-led pricing and options for therapy and short-term therapeutic supports.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfb;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#6b8e7f;--accent-2:#4a6b5b;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f1720}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f9f8 0%, #ffffff 40%);background-attachment:fixed}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(250,250,250,0.8));backdrop-filter: blur(6px);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;border-bottom:1px solid #eef1ef}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
    .hero{padding:36px 28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(14,20,18,0.06);padding:22px}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px;color:#0b2a22}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:var(--muted)}
    /* pricing list */
    .plans{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .plan{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #edf2ef}
    .plan strong{display:block;color:#08281f}
    .plan small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}
    .price{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-2)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* mood-to-method */
    .picker{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .choices{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .choice{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6efe8;background:#fcfffb;color:#0b2a22;cursor:pointer}
    .choice[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--accent);color:white;border-color:var(--accent-2)}

    .cta{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .btn.secondary{background:#eff6f2;color:var(--accent-2);border:1px solid #e6efe8}

    /* accordion */
    .accordion{margin-top:16px}
    .acc-item{border-top:1px solid #eef2ef}
    .acc-trigger{width:100%;padding:14px 0;background:none;border:0;text-align:left;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px}
    .acc-panel{padding:8px 0;color:var(--muted);display:none}

    footer{padding:22px 28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand .hide-sm{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">T</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">A private clinical practice</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html" style="color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach Out</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>Fees & Packages</h1>
          <p class="lead">My approach is individual first — here are the common ways I structure time and support. If you’d like a different rhythm (e.g., more frequent check-ins or brief consultations), let’s discuss it when you book.</p>

          <div class="plans" role="list">
            <div class="plan" role="listitem">
              <div>
                <strong>Clarity Session</strong>
                <small class="muted">A single focused 50-minute appointment to explore a specific concern.</small>
              </div>
              <div class="price">Starting $160</div>
            </div>

            <div class="plan" role="listitem">
              <div>
                <strong>Ongoing Therapy</strong>
                <small class="muted">Weekly or biweekly clinical sessions, 45–60 minutes. Recommended when deeper relational or mood patterns are in focus.</small>
              </div>
              <div class="price">Starting $180 / session</div>
            </div>

            <div class="plan" role="listitem">
              <div>
                <strong>Short-Term Intensive</strong>
                <small class="muted">A 4-session package intended to create momentum during transitional periods.</small>
              </div>
              <div class="price">Package $660</div>
            </div>

            <div class="plan" role="listitem">
              <div>
                <strong>Maintenance Add-On</strong>
                <small class="muted">A reduced-rate check-in option for clients who prefer less frequent support between blocks of therapy.</small>
              </div>
              <div class="price">Ask for details</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="note" style="margin-top:12px">Insurance: I do not bill insurance directly in most cases. I can provide a receipt (superbill) you may submit to your insurer; coverage varies by plan. Fees are subject to periodic review. There are no guarantees of outcomes; therapy aims to support exploration and change over time.</p>

          <div class="accordion">
            <div class="acc-item">
              <button class="acc-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Session boundaries & confidentiality</button>
              <div class="acc-panel">
                <p>Sessions are 45–60 minutes unless otherwise arranged. I maintain clinical records in a secure system. Communications by email or text are used for scheduling and brief touchpoints; they are not a substitute for clinical work. Confidentiality is protected within legal limits (e.g., risk of harm, child or elder safety, court orders). If you have questions about privacy, please ask — I will explain limits clearly.</p>
                <p class="muted">Cancellation: Please provide at least 48 hours' notice when possible. Late cancellations or missed sessions may incur a fee.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel" aria-labelledby="mood-heading">
        <h2 id="mood-heading">Mood-to-Method</h2>
        <p class="muted">Choose how you’re feeling and I’ll suggest a way to begin. The button will update to match that suggestion.</p>

        <div class="picker">
          <div class="choices" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Mood choices">
            <button class="choice" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-key="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="choice" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-key="stuck">Stuck</button>
            <button class="choice" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-key="grief">Navigating loss</button>
            <button class="choice" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-key="coping">Need tools to cope</button>
            <button class="choice" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-key="clarity">Want clarity fast</button>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <div id="method-summary" style="min-height:64px;color:#123327;font-weight:600">Select a state to see an approach.</div>
            <div class="cta">
              <a id="mood-cta" class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
              <a class="btn secondary" href="faq.html">Learn about privacy</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Quick note on fees</div>
          <div>Fees are due at the time of service. If cost is a barrier, we can discuss limited sliding-scale availability during first contact.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:0 28px 18px 28px">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">A clinician's framing</h3>
        <p class="muted">I describe options plainly because clarity around commitments helps therapy begin. If you're unsure where to start, the Clarity Session is a low-commitment way to see if the fit feels right. There are no promises of specific outcomes; therapy is collaborative and takes time.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:8px" class="muted">If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services (e.g., 911) or your local crisis line. For urgent mental health support, contact your local crisis resources. Clinician communications are not monitored 24/7.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    (function(){
      const map = {
        overwhelmed: {label:'Stabilization path',desc:'Short-term work focused on immediate coping strategies and pacing. Helpful when stress feels heavy.',cta:'Book a Stabilization Session',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=stabilize'},
        stuck: {label:'Pattern-focused sessions',desc:'Sessions that map repeated patterns and small practice steps to interrupt them.',cta:'Request Ongoing Sessions',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=ongoing'},
        grief: {label:'Grief & transition support',desc:'Gentle, time-bound work to make room for loss and practical reorganization.',cta:'Book a Grief Conversation',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=grief'},
        coping: {label:'Skills & toolbox',desc:'Short blocks that emphasize concrete coping skills and practices to use between sessions.',cta:'Try a Skills Session',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=skills'},
        clarity: {label:'Focused clarity session',desc:'A single-session format to clarify next steps and create a small plan.',cta:'Book a Clarity Session',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=clarity'}
      };

      const choices = document.querySelectorAll('.choice');
      const summary = document.getElementById('method-summary');
      const moodCta = document.getElementById('mood-cta');

      choices.forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        choices.forEach(b=> {b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false'); b.setAttribute('aria-checked','false');});
        btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true'); btn.setAttribute('aria-checked','true');
        const key = btn.getAttribute('data-key');
        const info = map[key];
        summary.textContent = info.label + ' — ' + info.desc;
        moodCta.textContent = info.cta;
        moodCta.href = info.url;
      }));

      // Simple accordion
      document.querySelectorAll('.acc-trigger').forEach(t=>{
        t.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          const expanded = t.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
          t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
          const panel = t.nextElementSibling;
          panel.style.display = expanded ? 'none' : 'block';
        });
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"faq.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Questions — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Answers to common questions about working together, confidentiality, and practical details.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#6b8e7f;--accent-2:#4a6b5b;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdfa,#ffffff);color:#0d271f}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef3ef}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{padding:22px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:20px}
    .card{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(12,18,14,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .faq-list{margin-top:12px}
    .qa{border-top:1px solid #eef3ef;padding:12px 0}
    .q{font-weight:700}
    .a{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
    .acc{margin-top:12px}
    .acc-trigger{width:100%;padding:10px 0;background:none;border:0;text-align:left;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .acc-panel{display:none;color:var(--muted);padding-top:8px}
    .cta{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700">T</div>
      <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html" style="color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach Out</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="grid">
      <section>
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
          <p class="small">Short answers from a clinician—practical details and what to expect.</p>

          <div class="faq-list">
            <div class="qa">
              <div class="q">How do I know if we’re a good fit?</div>
              <div class="a">A fit is often about feeling heard and understood in the first few sessions. I view the first 1–3 sessions as exploratory: we test ways of working together and set a shared plan. If you’re unsure, consider a Clarity Session to start.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="qa">
              <div class="q">Do you take insurance?</div>
              <div class="a">I generally do not bill insurance directly. I can provide a receipt (superbill) you can submit to your carrier. Coverage varies; contact your insurer for details. If cost is a barrier, mention it when you reach out and we can talk about options.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="qa">
              <div class="q">What is telehealth like?</div>
              <div class="a">Virtual sessions use a secure platform. We will check connection and privacy at the start of each session. If both parties agree, in-person options may be available depending on location and scheduling.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="qa">
              <div class="q">How long will therapy take?</div>
              <div class="a">There is no fixed timeline. Some concerns can be addressed in short-term work, others benefit from longer-term exploration. We will periodically review goals and progress together.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="qa">
              <div class="q">What if I need support outside session?</div>
              <div class="a">I am available by brief message for scheduling and urgent administrative matters. I do not provide crisis monitoring through email or text. For immediate danger, call emergency services.</div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="acc" style="margin-top:14px">
            <button class="acc-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Session boundaries & confidentiality</button>
            <div class="acc-panel">
              <p>Confidentiality is central. What you share is protected except in specific legal or safety-related circumstances (e.g., imminent danger to self/others, suspected abuse). Records are stored securely. We will discuss telehealth privacy and limits during intake.</p>
              <p class="small">Cancellation policy: When possible, give 48 hours' notice. Fees for late cancellations are described in the intake paperwork.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">When to choose a single session</h2>
          <p class="small">A focused Clarity Session is often right when you need one careful conversation to orient next steps. It’s also a reasonable first step if you’re testing the fit.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Mood-to-Method</h3>
          <p class="small">Pick where you are now and see a suggested starting format.</p>

          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <select id="faq-mood" aria-label="Select mood">
              <option value="clarity">Want clarity fast</option>
              <option value="coping">Need coping tools</option>
              <option value="stuck">Feeling stuck in patterns</option>
              <option value="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</option>
            </select>

            <div id="faq-suggest" style="font-weight:700;color:#113327">Select an option to see a suggestion.</div>

            <div class="cta">
              <a id="faq-cta" class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">If you are unsure or in a crisis, see the note below.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:14px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Respectful crisis guidance</h4>
          <p class="small">If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services (e.g., 911). For urgent emotional support, contact your local crisis line. Clinician contact is not a replacement for emergency care.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer style="padding:18px;border-top:1px solid #eef3ef;color:var(--muted)">
    <div>Contact: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    (function(){
      const map = {
        clarity:{text:'A single 50-minute Clarity Session can help you name next steps.',cta:'Book a Clarity Session',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=clarity'},
        coping:{text:'Consider a short skills block to learn immediate coping strategies.',cta:'Reserve a Skills Block',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=skills'},
        stuck:{text:'Pattern-focused work across sessions may be most helpful.',cta:'Explore Ongoing Sessions',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=ongoing'},
        overwhelmed:{text:'Early stabilization work can help reduce intensity and create safety.',cta:'Request Stabilization Support',url:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=stabilize'}
      };

      const select = document.getElementById('faq-mood');
      const suggest = document.getElementById('faq-suggest');
      const cta = document.getElementById('faq-cta');

      function update(){
        const key = select.value;
        const info = map[key];
        suggest.textContent = info.text;
        cta.textContent = info.cta;
        cta.href = info.url;
      }

      select.addEventListener('change', update);
      update();

      // accordion behavior
      document.querySelectorAll('.acc-trigger').forEach(t=>{
        t.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          const expanded = t.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
          t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
          const panel = t.nextElementSibling;
          panel.style.display = expanded ? 'none' : 'block';
        });
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Book a Session — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Request an appointment or ask a scheduling question.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f9fdfb;--muted:#586a62;--accent:#5f8f78;--accent-2:#3f6a56;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdfc,#ffffff);color:#04221b}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #eaf3ef}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px}
    .card{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(8,20,16,0.04)}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border:1px solid #e6efe8;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px}
    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    @media (max-width:880px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700">T</div>
      <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html" style="color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach Out</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <div class="card">
        <h1 style="margin-top:0">Book a session</h1>
        <p class="small">Use this form to request an appointment. I will respond within a few business days with availability and next steps.</p>

        <form id="booking-form" action="javascript:;" novalidate>
          <div>
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" required />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="mood-select">Which option describes how you’re feeling right now?</label>
            <select id="mood-select" name="mood">
              <option value="clarity">I want clarity on one issue</option>
              <option value="coping">I need tools to cope</option>
              <option value="ongoing">I think I need ongoing therapy</option>
              <option value="urgent">I feel overwhelmed</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="notes">Brief note (what would you like to focus on?)</label>
            <textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>

          <input type="hidden" id="suggested-path" name="suggested_path" value="">

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
            <button id="submit-btn" class="btn">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <div class="small">Or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>

          <div class="hint">Your information will be kept private consistent with clinical practice. See details below about confidentiality.</div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <button class="acc-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Session boundaries & confidentiality</button>
          <div class="acc-panel" style="display:none;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">
            <p>Confidentiality is a core part of therapy. I keep secure clinical records. Exceptions to confidentiality include imminent risk of harm, mandated reporting, and legal processes. Please ask if you want more detail; I will explain how I manage records, telehealth, and secure messaging.</p>
            <p class="small">If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services. If you do not feel safe, please call your local emergency number or crisis resources.</p>
          </div>
