        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Mood-to-Method</h4>
          <p class="small">Pick your current state and the form will suggest a starting structure. This helps me prepare before our first conversation.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <button class="choice" data-key="clarity">Clarity</button>
            <button class="choice" data-key="coping">Coping</button>
            <button class="choice" data-key="ongoing">Ongoing</button>
            <button class="choice" data-key="urgent">Stabilize</button>
          </div>

          <div id="side-suggest" style="margin-top:12px;font-weight:700;color:#123327">Select an option to see a suggested path.</div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">If you are in crisis and cannot keep yourself safe, call emergency services or your local crisis line now. This form is not monitored for emergencies.</div>
